    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kapih</strong> is a classic run-n-gun shooter platformer, with action packed levels and boss battles. The visuals and music are inspired by the many lost in time art-styles of India. We follow the adventure of our protagonist <i>Vaanar</i> (monkey) who is a common kid in a colorfully imagined ancient India.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/6ca18e3da5a77b1902e4c0899e0949da.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/6ca18e3da5a77b1902e4c0899e0949da.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is classic run-n-gun with 8 shooting directions. The controls are tight and not physics based. As you advance through the game, unlock an arsenal of new weapons and power-ups to enhance your playstyle, making each level an exhilarating and strategic experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While run-n-gun is the primary mechanic, <strong>Kapih</strong> also features additional game modes such as horizontal shoot-em-up and vehicle levels. Craving some bullet hell action? We got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/d5320c986d702af0f45084f67a5bdb65.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/d5320c986d702af0f45084f67a5bdb65.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Couch Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vaanar</i> is the protagonist around whom the main campaign revolves, but if a co-op player joins, he is accompanied by his charming female-vaanar friend named <i>\u201cBindu\u201d</i>. She is an equally great fighter as him: whether you play as <i>Vaanar</i> or <i>Bindu</i>, your mechanics and playstyle remains the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/f205435b1cfef72f1c773d10a0f6b16c.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/f205435b1cfef72f1c773d10a0f6b16c.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for heart-pounding excitement as you face epic boss battles at the end of each level, where every victory brings you one step closer to legendary glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4e9b7b25b2ceb1a5622df65248f1ba8.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4e9b7b25b2ceb1a5622df65248f1ba8.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CG Animated Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories are always told from the point of view of the heroes and the leaders. However the stories of the followers are always forgotten and remain untold. <strong>Kapih</strong> addresses this with a story of a common kid, which takes place at the backdrop of events of the <i>Ramayana</i>, one of the greatest epics of South East Asia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a story of how an otherwise ordinary life is suddenly rattled up by extraordinary events which in turn shape his destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4940bb327c9319be4da9dde8bfa92ae.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4940bb327c9319be4da9dde8bfa92ae.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in stunning CG animated cutscenes that bring to life a captivating story inspired by the ancient legends unfolding an unforgettable adventure with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Kapih</strong>, we pay our homage, all the way from India, to our beloved retro classics. We retain the original but add modern elements, transformed and combined with Indian cultural sensibilities. In a world of ever increasing complexity in video games, we aspire to offer an experience with simple yet fun mechanics, tight controls, never before seen visual and musical treat, in a potently nostalgic package.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kapih</strong> is a classic run-n-gun shooter platformer, with action packed levels and boss battles. The visuals and music are inspired by the many lost in time art-styles of India. We follow the adventure of our protagonist <i>Vaanar</i> (monkey) who is a common kid in a colorfully imagined ancient India.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/6ca18e3da5a77b1902e4c0899e0949da.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/6ca18e3da5a77b1902e4c0899e0949da.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is classic run-n-gun with 8 shooting directions. The controls are tight and not physics based. As you advance through the game, unlock an arsenal of new weapons and power-ups to enhance your playstyle, making each level an exhilarating and strategic experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While run-n-gun is the primary mechanic, <strong>Kapih</strong> also features additional game modes such as horizontal shoot-em-up and vehicle levels. Craving some bullet hell action? We got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/d5320c986d702af0f45084f67a5bdb65.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/d5320c986d702af0f45084f67a5bdb65.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Couch Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vaanar</i> is the protagonist around whom the main campaign revolves, but if a co-op player joins, he is accompanied by his charming female-vaanar friend named <i>\u201cBindu\u201d</i>. She is an equally great fighter as him: whether you play as <i>Vaanar</i> or <i>Bindu</i>, your mechanics and playstyle remains the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/f205435b1cfef72f1c773d10a0f6b16c.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/f205435b1cfef72f1c773d10a0f6b16c.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for heart-pounding excitement as you face epic boss battles at the end of each level, where every victory brings you one step closer to legendary glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4e9b7b25b2ceb1a5622df65248f1ba8.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4e9b7b25b2ceb1a5622df65248f1ba8.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CG Animated Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories are always told from the point of view of the heroes and the leaders. However the stories of the followers are always forgotten and remain untold. <strong>Kapih</strong> addresses this with a story of a common kid, which takes place at the backdrop of events of the <i>Ramayana</i>, one of the greatest epics of South East Asia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a story of how an otherwise ordinary life is suddenly rattled up by extraordinary events which in turn shape his destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4940bb327c9319be4da9dde8bfa92ae.poster.avif?t=1747142663\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337060/extras/b4940bb327c9319be4da9dde8bfa92ae.webm?t=1747142663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in stunning CG animated cutscenes that bring to life a captivating story inspired by the ancient legends unfolding an unforgettable adventure with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Kapih</strong>, we pay our homage, all the way from India, to our beloved retro classics. We retain the original but add modern elements, transformed and combined with Indian cultural sensibilities. In a world of ever increasing complexity in video games, we aspire to offer an experience with simple yet fun mechanics, tight controls, never before seen visual and musical treat, in a potently nostalgic package.</p>",
